Text_en:
In all the years that I worked as a news reporter and dealt with verifying video, witness accounts and breaking news, I witnessed Vahid Online. 
@Vahid
 How did he cover the news of protests and killings accurately and without looking. Finding his identity when he doesn't want to give more information, who does it help but the Islamic Republic?

